              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqnis halkan sana akkasuma godhe. Rifeensa hoolaa sana qofatu goggogaa ture; lafti guutuun fixeensaan haguugamee ture.",
          "type": "text",
